# ROADMAP 4.4 the impinging-plume starter: New case > Plume on a surface, the numbers worked out live from the nozzle
# exit state (a, Ue, p0, NPR, Mach disk, mesh, time step), a refused input, the case written and run with real
# rhoCentralFoam (end time cut short for the test), and the continuum check at 100 Pa ambient.
click nav:new case
wait-until page New case
click starter-plume
wait-until modal any timeout 5
assert text Ue = Me·a = 3 × 353.1 = 1059.2 m/s
assert text NPR = p0/pa = 1837
assert text = 0.574 m, beyond the
assert text Mesh: 50 × (10 + 36) = 2300 cells
screenshot $OUT/plume_form.png
dump $OUT/form.txt
click pl-f#0
key A ctrl
type 0.5
wait 3
assert text The exit Mach number must be 1 or more
assert not enabled pl-go
click pl-f#0
key A ctrl
type 3
wait 3
click pl-name
key A ctrl
type plumeTest
click pl-go
wait-until page Overview timeout 10
assert file README.plume
assert log system/controlDict application     rhoCentralFoam;
assert log 0/U uniform (1059.2 0 0)
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
wait 10
assert text Slip flow at the
click dict:system/controlDict:endTime
enter 2e-05
wait 3
key S ctrl
wait 5
click run-go
wait 10
click? m-pc-go
wait-until job running timeout 30
wait-until job finished timeout 300
assert log log.rhoCentralFoam End
assert file postProcessing/platePressure/0/surfaceFieldValue.dat
screenshot $OUT/plume_run.png
